#>texture_parchment
#:material #!paper

~parchment[paper]{deckled edges, visible fibre, soft tooth}

// the studio's standing look, so the file opens on texture.website as the line it would make
~parchment[close, overcast, handled, as-found](wall)<tile>

word: "parchment"
science: "Plant fibres felted into a sheet; how long the fibres are and how the sheet is pressed decide its tooth, its translucency and how it takes ink."
